# Traffic Image Annotation Project

## Project Overview
This is a personal practice project created to learn and demonstrate image data annotation using CVAT (Computer Vision Annotation Tool).

## Image Description
The image represents a traffic scene used for object annotation practice.

## Tools Used
- CVAT (Computer Vision Annotation Tool)
- COCO 1.0 annotation format
- GitHub

## Annotation Tasks
- Object labeling
- Bounding-box annotation
- Identifying objects in a traffic scene
- Following annotation guidelines

## Dataset Files
- `traffic.jpg` — Original practice image
- `instances_default.json` — Exported annotation data in COCO format

## Skills Demonstrated
- Image data annotation
- Object detection annotation concepts
- Bounding-box labeling
- Annotation data export and organization

## Project Purpose
The purpose of this project is to build practical experience in image annotation and develop skills relevant to computer vision datasets.

**Project Type:** Personal Learning & Practice Project
